      "Differentiation": "• Strong – the concept of ‘heirloom-quality goods’ combined with verifiable provenance is a unique selling point. The proposed registry function adds significant value.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Well-defined impact measurement – focusing on time savings and audit query reduction for pilot users.  The proposed API documentation is a valuable deliverable.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Good risk awareness (privacy, scalability, integration). The lightweight implementation and focus on anonymized data are sensible mitigations."
    }
  },
  "winner": "B"
}
